{"id":"rdd36","designation":"RDD 36","title":"Apple ProRes Bitstream Syntax and Decoding Process","state":"active","suite":null,"official":{"family_url":"https://pub.smpte.org/doc/rdd36/","latest_url":"https://pub.smpte.org/latest/rdd36/","checked_at":"2026-11-11"},"scope":"This SMPTE Registered Disclosure Document (RDD) includes specifications for the Apple ProRes bitstream syntax, the bitstream element semantics, and the decoding process used to produce decompressed images. A reference implementation that reads ProRes bitstreams from a file and decompresses the bitstreams is part of the contribution. Sample bitstreams and the resulting decompressed images have also been contributed for exercising the reference implementation. This RDD does not describe the Apple QuickTime file format or the details of storing ProRes bitstreams in QuickTime files.","outline":[],"definitions":[{"term":"Frame Header Syntax","definition":"frame_header() {"},{"term":"Picture Syntax","definition":"picture(temporalOrder) {"},{"term":"Picture Header Syntax","definition":"picture_header() {"},{"term":"Slice Header Syntax","definition":"slice_header() {"},{"term":"Scanned Coefficients Syntax","definition":"scanned_coefficients(coefficients, numBlocks, dataSize) {"},{"term":"Scanned Alpha Syntax","definition":"scanned_alpha(alphaValues, numValues) {"},{"term":"Frame Header Semantics","definition":"frame_header_size"},{"term":"Picture Semantics","definition":"picture_vertical_size"},{"term":"Picture Header Semantics","definition":"picture_header_size"},{"term":"Slice Header Semantics","definition":"slice_header_size"},{"term":"Scanned Coefficients Semantics","definition":"first_dc_coeff"},{"term":"Scanned Alpha Semantics","definition":"alpha_difference"}],"keywords":[{"term":"Wide-Screen Scanning","zh":"宽银幕扫描","abbr":"","category":"film","source":"curated"},{"term":"Transfer Function","zh":"传递函数","abbr":"","category":"measurement","source":"curated"},{"term":"Ultra High Definition","zh":"超高清"